# <summary line: imperative, under 50 chars, what changed>
# Blank line, then the body: why the change was needed, in wrapped lines.
# Use bullet points (each starting with a hyphen or an asterisk) when listing
# several changes or motivations.
#
# Keep each commit a single, self-contained issue — it makes review easier.
# Reference the related issue or PR where applicable, e.g. (#1234).
#
# Footer (optional): BREAKING CHANGE: <description of what breaks and the
# migration path> — also add a CHANGELOG.md entry under "Unreleased".
